1
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,320
The ocean sounds peaceful.

2
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,650
Getting beaten this badly,

3
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:38,930
was it worth it?

4
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,730
Worth every second.

5
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,770
He abused me, faked his image,
toyed with my feelings,

6
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,460
and leaked my private photos.

7
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:51,790
Now he's lost everything.

8
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,500
I couldn't be happier.

9
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,020
But you, Dr. Jiang,

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,810
you keep helping me.

11
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,160
Tell me.

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,330
What do you want from me?

13
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,820
Why are you

14
00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:16,420
staying here?

15
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,880
No reason.

16
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,080
I killed someone.

17
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:35,160
Needed somewhere quiet to hide.

18
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,870
Just joking, Dr. Jiang.

19
00:01:51,930 --> 00:01:53,789
You didn't believe that, did you?

20
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:56,870
Tell me how I should repay you.

21
00:01:56,930 --> 00:01:58,410
I don't like

22
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,520
owing anyone.

23
00:02:39,730 --> 00:02:43,240
So this is the reward you want?

24
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,100
So the rumors about you

25
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,650
weren't completely wrong.

26
00:02:51,210 --> 00:02:53,470
You really are quite easygoing with men.

27
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:56,829
Well, this is what happens in dramas.

28
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,920
When a man removes his glasses,

29
00:02:59,290 --> 00:03:01,120
he's asking for a kiss

30
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,050
And...

31
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:05,170
I'm Wen Jianan.

32
00:03:06,010 --> 00:03:07,270
You're getting lucky.

33
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:13,350
[Dearest Episode 3]

34
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:18,050
You think a kiss is enough?

35
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,840
I want more.

36
00:03:22,210 --> 00:03:23,490
Much more.

37
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:29,210
The more you want,

38
00:03:30,170 --> 00:03:31,800
the more you'll have to give.

39
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,290
Dr. Jiang,

40
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:37,420
what else can you do for me?

41
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:39,560
That depends...

42
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:42,360
on what you need, Miss Wen.

43
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:50,710
I need you

44
00:03:52,170 --> 00:03:53,800
to get me out of here.

45
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:57,980
I want to stand on stage again,
under the spotlight,

46
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:00,640
and take back what's mine.

47
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,330
I see.

48
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:09,360
So this is what you want.

49
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,960
Then I'll destroy it all.

50
00:04:13,010 --> 00:04:13,890
Dr. Jiang,

51
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:15,740
I'll find out

52
00:04:16,410 --> 00:04:18,649
what you're really after.

53
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,120
Mr. He.

54
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:26,410
We've completed the paternity test.

55
00:04:26,410 --> 00:04:27,880
The doctor named Jiang Yu

56
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:30,080
is indeed your son with Jiang Yuqing.

57
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,159
We broke up,

58
00:04:32,490 --> 00:04:35,120
and she didn't abort the baby as agreed.

59
00:04:35,340 --> 00:04:37,659
She actually gave birth to him.

60
00:04:39,850 --> 00:04:42,290
No wonder the first time I saw him,

61
00:04:42,290 --> 00:04:44,090
I felt something was different.

62
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,690
That look in his eyes

63
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:47,620
and that presence...

64
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,440
So he carries my blood.

65
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:02,680
Hurry!

66
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,240
Faster!

67
00:05:05,290 --> 00:05:05,930
Come on!

68
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:12,390
Where is Dr. Jiang?

69
00:05:12,570 --> 00:05:13,570
In the VIP ward.

70
00:05:16,290 --> 00:05:16,880
Hurry up!

71
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,220
Be careful.

72
00:05:49,170 --> 00:05:49,730
Yes?

73
00:05:49,730 --> 00:05:50,320
Hello.

74
00:05:50,530 --> 00:05:52,650
Mr. He, the fire has been put out.

75
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,260
There were no casualties.

76
00:05:54,650 --> 00:05:55,240
But...

77
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,440
But what? Say it.

78
00:05:57,050 --> 00:05:59,650
Miss Wen and Dr. Jiang
weren't in the fire zone.

79
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
The surveillance system
also malfunctioned.

80
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,120
We searched every corner of the facility.

81
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,200
They're gone.

82
00:06:06,650 --> 00:06:07,560
Gone?

83
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,440
I don't care what you have to do.

84
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,440
You find them within two hours!

85
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,610
Otherwise,

86
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:14,320
you and that worthless rehab center

87
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,360
can be gone too!

88
00:06:17,650 --> 00:06:18,560
Dad,

89
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,670
were you looking for me?

90
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,610
It was just a little joke.

91
00:06:57,930 --> 00:06:59,120
Nobody got hurt.

92
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,120
You're not mad, are you?

93
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,000
Let me introduce everyone.

94
00:07:25,530 --> 00:07:27,410
This is Dr. Jiang Yu.

95
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:31,080
He's now my personal rehab therapist.

96
00:07:31,170 --> 00:07:32,409
He'll be staying here

97
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,890
and monitoring my condition at all times.

98
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,970
Mr. Wen.

99
00:07:38,409 --> 00:07:39,300
Nice to meet you.

100
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,560
May I offer you a drink?

101
00:07:46,970 --> 00:07:48,600
Dr. Jiang, you're too kind.

102
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,710
We should offer you a drink.

103
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:53,440
Jianan went through
such a serious car accident,

104
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,290
and you've taken such careful care of her.

105
00:07:55,290 --> 00:07:57,090
She's recovered so well under your care.

106
00:07:57,090 --> 00:07:57,850
So, please,

107
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,940
accept this drink.
On behalf of the family, thank you.

108
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:01,620
He Mu.

109
00:08:04,090 --> 00:08:05,560
When did our family dining table

110
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,750
become a place for ceremonial toasts?

111
00:08:13,170 --> 00:08:14,090
You're right.

112
00:08:15,410 --> 00:08:17,880
Let's just enjoy the meal.

113
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,490
Mr. Wen is right.

114
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,880
I'll do as the host wishes.

115
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,210
Since Mr. Wen

116
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,490
dislikes these unnecessary rituals,

117
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:31,130
I'll consider this a toast
to the excellent dinner before us.

118
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,080
I'll drink it all.

119
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,370
Dr. Jiang, impressive tolerance.

120
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:50,040
I wonder where you learned it.

121
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:51,890
And

122
00:08:52,230 --> 00:08:54,830
for Jianan's legs to heal so quickly,

123
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:58,200
your methods must be extraordinary.

124
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:05,090
Such skill does not come from
an ordinary rehabilitation clinic.

125
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,680
It reminds me of somewhere.

126
00:09:09,250 --> 00:09:11,130
The Cloudsea Club.

127
00:09:14,590 --> 00:09:16,280
Ever heard of it, Dr. Jiang?

128
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,200
The Cloudsea Club.

129
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,680
I've heard of it.

130
00:09:22,130 --> 00:09:23,010
There was

131
00:09:23,010 --> 00:09:24,770
a huge scandal there recently.

132
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:26,560
A waiter

133
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,640
killed a woman in a car accident.

134
00:09:29,130 --> 00:09:31,130
It was even his birthday that day.

135
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,600
A rich woman spent a fortune

136
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:34,930
completing

137
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:37,290
28 years' worth of birthday gifts for him.

138
00:09:37,530 --> 00:09:40,480
It was quite a scene.

139
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,530
Mrs. Wen,

140
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,840
did you know about this?

141
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,400
I didn't.

142
00:09:52,530 --> 00:09:54,170
I've been busy with

143
00:09:54,170 --> 00:09:55,530
my museum exhibition.

144
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:57,010
I don't have time

145
00:09:57,010 --> 00:09:59,250
for random gossip.

146
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,250
Since Jianan is back,

147
00:10:04,370 --> 00:10:05,320
your museum

148
00:10:05,350 --> 00:10:08,110
will be handed over to her
starting tomorrow.

149
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:12,960
What?

150
00:10:13,290 --> 00:10:15,250
I built that museum myself.

151
00:10:15,250 --> 00:10:16,710
Why should I give it to her?

152
00:10:17,050 --> 00:10:18,050
See for yourself!

153
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:22,560
Girls, tonight is on me.

154
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,480
A small gift for you.

155
00:10:30,710 --> 00:10:32,070
You damn girl!

156
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:35,170
Dad, I'm sorry.

157
00:10:35,170 --> 00:10:36,290
It's my fault.

158
00:10:36,290 --> 00:10:37,890
I was too occupied with business

159
00:10:37,890 --> 00:10:38,890
and neglected Wen Xin.

160
00:10:38,890 --> 00:10:40,370
That's why she did something

161
00:10:40,370 --> 00:10:41,770
that disgraced

162
00:10:41,890 --> 00:10:43,440
the company and the family.

163
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,370
It's my fault.

164
00:10:46,170 --> 00:10:47,080
Disgrace?

165
00:10:48,930 --> 00:10:49,720
He Mu.

166
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,650
You know exactly why I sought comfort

167
00:10:51,650 --> 00:10:52,800
elsewhere!

168
00:10:53,370 --> 00:10:54,200
Oh, right.

169
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,580
Because you couldn't do your job as a man!

170
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,890
You damn girl!

171
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:00,350
Dad, it's all my fault.

172
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,560
I failed as a husband.

173
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,930
Punish me instead.

174
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:04,680
Don't hit her.

175
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,050
You want to protect her?

176
00:11:06,050 --> 00:11:07,480
Fine. Protect her!

177
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,530
I'll hit you!

178
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,650
Dad! Dad!

179
00:11:13,650 --> 00:11:14,290
Stop!

180
00:11:14,290 --> 00:11:15,530
He Mu, get up!

181
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,020
Don't act like some saint!

182
00:11:17,890 --> 00:11:18,530
Dad,

183
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:20,480
hit me if you want.

184
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,680
Like you used to.

185
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:22,680
I know I was wrong.

186
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:23,320
Get lost!

187
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:24,800
You loser.

188
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,260
Beating you is pointless.

189
00:11:26,930 --> 00:11:27,650
Move aside!

190
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,750
Dad, calm down.

191
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:30,420
Dad.

192
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,240
You can walk?

193
00:11:56,590 --> 00:11:59,050
What a beautiful picture
of a loving couple.

194
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,250
Mom.

195
00:12:04,290 --> 00:12:07,600
Everything you've done to hurt me,
then and now,

196
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:10,750
I'll return it all.

197
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:13,370
We have all the time in the world.
